{"4631050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You Can't Ring It", "steam_appid": 4631050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You Can't Ring It</i> is a 3D physics challenge game built around one core idea: not just landing the ring, but making it stay on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules could not be simpler: <br>throw the ring, land it on the target, clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once you start playing, you will realize that hitting the target is only the beginning. <br>You need to control your angle, power, spin, and timing to make the ring truly drop, catch, and stay hooked before it counts as a success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every failure makes it clear what went wrong. <br>Every success feels like forcing an almost impossible move to finally happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through handcrafted stages, with each level introducing new mechanics and twists. You will face far more than ordinary targets: horizontal pipes, moving ostriches, shifting wind, rotating fans, glass bank shots, dolphins dashing across the stage, and all kinds of absurd-looking setups that are somehow still possible to ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You Can't Ring It</i> is both chaotic and hardcore. <br>It is easy to understand, but far from easy to master. <br>This is the kind of game that keeps making you say, “one more try.”</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You Can't Ring It</i> is a 3D physics challenge game built around one core idea: not just landing the ring, but making it stay on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules could not be simpler: <br>throw the ring, land it on the target, clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once you start playing, you will realize that hitting the target is only the beginning. <br>You need to control your angle, power, spin, and timing to make the ring truly drop, catch, and stay hooked before it counts as a success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every failure makes it clear what went wrong. <br>Every success feels like forcing an almost impossible move to finally happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses through handcrafted stages, with each level introducing new mechanics and twists. You will face far more than ordinary targets: horizontal pipes, moving ostriches, shifting wind, rotating fans, glass bank shots, dolphins dashing across the stage, and all kinds of absurd-looking setups that are somehow still possible to ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You Can't Ring It</i> is both chaotic and hardcore. <br>It is easy to understand, but far from easy to master. <br>This is the kind of game that keeps making you say, “one more try.”</p>", "short_description": "You Can’t Ring It is a playful physics-based tossing game where every throw matters. Aim carefully, adjust your angle and power, and land perfect rings on moving, tricky targets across a series of humorous handcrafted levels", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631050/8ed2539266ea04ee2c33a444288e92f419bc5f87/header.jpg?t=1778655797", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631050/c56f864aea753a644909dbc4f4e685941397b55d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778655797", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4631050/c56f864aea753a644909dbc4f4e685941397b55d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778655797", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</st